    "synopsis": {
        "native": "\u00c0 sa sortie de prison, Dieumerci, 44 ans, d\u00e9cide de changer de vie et de suivre son r\u00eave : devenir com\u00e9dien. Pour y arriver, il s\u2019inscrit \u00e0 des cours de th\u00e9\u00e2tre qu'il finance par des missions d'int\u00e9rim. Mais il n'est pas au bout de ses peines. Son bin\u00f4me Cl\u00e9ment, 22 ans, lui est oppos\u00e9 en tout. Dieumerci va devoir composer avec ce petit \"emmerdeur\". Il l\u2019accueille dans sa vie pr\u00e9caire faite d'une modeste chambre d'h\u00f4tel et de chantiers. Au fil des gal\u00e8res et des r\u00e9p\u00e9titions, nos deux h\u00e9ros vont apprendre \u00e0 se conna\u00eetre et s\u2019\u00e9pauler pour tenter d'atteindre l'inaccessible \u00e9toile.",
        "english": "Upon his release from prison, forty-four-year-old Dieumerci decides to change his life and to follow his dream: to become an actor. To do so, he follows an acting course which he pays for through part-time jobs. But there are still challenges ahead. His partner Cl\u00e9ment, twenty-two years old, is his exact opposite. Dieumerci must make do with this little \"pain in the ass.\" He welcomes him into his precarious life, consisting of a modest hotel room and building work jobs. As hardships and rehearsals go by, our two heroes will learn to know and to support each other in an attempt to reach the impossible star."
    },
